{"seq":11,"slug":"on-ten-major-relationships","title":"论十大关系","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/11_on-ten-major-relationships","introMarkdown":"# 论十大关系 简介\n\n《论十大关系》是毛泽东于一九五六年四月在中央政治局扩大会议上的讲话，是中国共产党探索适合本国国情的社会主义建设道路的开创性文献。全文在总结苏联社会主义建设经验教训和新中国六年建设实践的基础上，围绕经济建设和政治生活中十个重大关系展开辩证分析，提出了调动一切积极因素为社会主义事业服务的基本方针，标志着中国共产党开始独立思考社会主义建设的中国道路。\n\n本知识库适用于希望深入理解中国社会主义建设早期探索与辩证治理思想的读者，无论是马克思主义理论研究者、中国当代史学习者，还是对国家治理中平衡多重关系的方法论感兴趣的一般读者，都能从本书的精读中获得系统的辩证分析与战略思维训练。\n\n第一章**背景与方法论**，还原一九五六年社会主义改造基本完成后中国面临的新形势，分析苏联模式的经验教训对中国领导层的深刻触动，并阐述毛泽东在这一时期运用的大规模调查研究方法及其辩证分析思路。\n\n第二章**经济关系**，深入分析毛泽东论述的前三组经济领域重大关系：重工业与轻工业、农业的关系，沿海工业与内地工业的关系，经济建设与国防建设的关系，揭示其中蕴含的统筹兼顾、协调发展的经济辩证法。\n\n第三章**政治关系**，系统阐述国家、生产单位和个人三者利益关系的协调原则，中央与地方权力划分的辩证逻辑，以及汉族与少数民族关系的处理方针，展现毛泽东对政治生活中多重矛盾的辩证把握。\n\n第四章**治理关系**，分析党与非党关系中\"长期共存、互相监督\"方针的理论意义，以及中国与外国关系中学习外国一切长处的开放态度，探讨这些治理原则对当代中国政治实践的持续启示。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立对历史背景与方法论的整体认知，理解十大关系提出的时代动因；再依次在第二章和第三章中掌握经济关系与政治关系的辩证分析方法；最后在第四章中完成对治理关系的理解，把握\"调动一切积极因素\"这一贯穿全文的基本方针。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"context-methodology","title":"背景与方法论","docCount":2,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/context-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-context-socialist-exploration","title":"社会主义建设初期的探索","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/context-methodology/historical-context-socialist-exploration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"investigation-methodology","title":"调查研究的方法论","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/context-methodology/investigation-methodology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-relationships","title":"经济关系","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/economic-relationships","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"heavy-light-agriculture-industry","title":"重工业与轻工业、农业","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/economic-relationships/heavy-light-agriculture-industry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coastal-inland-development","title":"沿海与内地工业","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/economic-relationships/coastal-inland-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"economic-construction-defense","title":"经济建设与国防建设","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/economic-relationships/economic-construction-defense"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"political-relationships","title":"政治关系","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/political-relationships","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-producer-collective","title":"国家、生产单位和个人","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/political-relationships/state-producer-collective"},{"seq":2,"slug":"central-local-relations","title":"中央与地方关系","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/political-relationships/central-local-relations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"han-minority-nationalities","title":"汉族与少数民族","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/political-relationships/han-minority-nationalities"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-relationships","title":"治理关系","docCount":2,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/governance-relationships","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"party-non-party-relations","title":"党与非党关系","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/governance-relationships/party-non-party-relations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-foreign-countries","title":"中国与外国关系","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-ten-major-relationships/governance-relationships/china-foreign-countries"}]}]}